Wait, timing: d(1,2) at t=0. Timer scheduled for t=20. d(3) at t=0 — ignored. Timer fires at t=20 with args [1,2]. d(4) at t=40 — but wait, after timer fires at t=20, timer is set to null. Then at t=40, d(4) schedules a new timer for t=60. Hmm, my test logic is off.

